### Nomad ###
# The decrypted MGO2.elf and other local reference binaries — tier-1 authority for disassembly,
# but a large copyrighted game binary that must not be committed. Keep it here locally.
dev/ref/

# Local tooling state
.claude/

# Recreated by the Maven container; never has anything worth keeping
tmp/

### mgo2server: generated analysis output
# Extracted from the retail disc (Solideye + Gcx) and from container logs. Both are large and
# regenerable, and the string dumps are Konami's text — reproduce them locally, do not vendor them.
dev/analysis/strings/
dev/analysis/logs/
dev/tools/__pycache__/

# Third-party binaries, not ours to redistribute. Keep them here locally (see ASSETS.md for what
# they're for).
dev/tools/gcx/
dev/tools/solideye/

# Konami's actual EULA text -- what the dev HTTP-probe harness serves verbatim to a real client at
# .../policy/policy.txt (not part of the built image; see compose.yaml's probe-http/probe-https
# mounts) once you copy it into place over the tracked placeholder there. Keep the real copy here
# locally as policy.txt.original; it is not ours to redistribute. See policy.txt (tracked) for the
# placeholder and instructions, and dev/docs/SETUP.md, "Verifying the pieces".
dev/runtime/www/us/mgo2/policy/policy.txt.original
*.bak
*.bak2
